<p>
  The document is one <code>Y.Text</code> named <code>code</code>, connected to
  CodeMirror 6 with <code>y-codemirror.next</code>. Other people's cursors and
  selections come through awareness. The server has nothing specific to code
  editing. It saves and forwards these updates the same way it does for the
  other demos. Try typing on the same line in both windows.
</p>
